ing or disposition.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1040,\"path\":\"standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md\",\"quote\":\"The frame returns evidence and a closed evaluation result, not Product meaning or disposition.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md#EXECUTIVE_BASELINE%2F11.%20Derived%20generic%20specialist%20frame%20set\",\"start_line\":1040}],\"label\":\"Proof\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"objects","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:d0bcad3e67ee7a6d8ee84a7dac175dce","key":242,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:d0bcad3e67ee7a6d8ee84a7dac175dce\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"sort\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:sort:authored-concept\",\"value\":{\"conditions\":[\"A generic frame is recursively refined.\"],\"definition\":\"A frame dependency relation opened only for a material distinction needed to close the parent evaluation. Each child records parent contract, purpose, material entities, identity and lifecycle relations, semantic owners, direct sibling seams, applicable invariants and prohibited competing paths. It is neither an organisational nor a runtime hierarchy.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1074,\"path\":\"standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md\",\"quote\":\"Refinement opens only for a material\\ndistinction needed to close the parent evaluation.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md#EXECUTIVE_BASELINE%2F11.%20Derived%20generic%20specialist%20frame%20set%2FRefinement%20and%20conjunction\",\"start_line\":1071}],\"label\":\"Recursive frame refinement\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"objects","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:a26fcfb2cee7c0a47e945e6b5a3a6428","key":243,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:a26fcfb2cee7c0a47e945e6b5a3a6428\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"sort\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:sort:authored-concept\",\"value\":{\"conditions\":[],\"definition\":\"Coverage is the union of admissible observations contributed by activated frames. A composite claim receives its declared conjunction's reported value. Every material cross-frame seam is mandatory result or required coverage, preserving or lawfully translating exact identity, coordinate, basis, value or evidence, lifecycle scope, authority and provenance.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1086,\"path\":\"standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md\",\"quote\":\"Coverage records the union of admissible observations the activated frames\\ncontribute.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md#EXECUTIVE_BASELINE%2F11.%20Derived%20generic%20specialist%20frame%20set%2FRefinement%20and%20conjunction\",\"start_line\":1076}],\"label\":\"Coverage and composite claim\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"objects","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:172726d28081cee7d3c416fe1c50447c","key":244,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:172726d28081cee7d3c416fe1c50447c\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"sort\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:sort:authored-concept\",\"value\":{\"conditions\":[\"The specialist set is adopted.\"],\"definition\":\"ASSURANCE §7 user-acceptance, end-to-end, integration and unit testing frames supply claim-congruent evidence to one or more Proof evaluations while retaining distinct claims and coordinates. Proof supplies neither a testing hierarchy nor aggregate-green substitution.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1115,\"path\":\"standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md\",\"quote\":\"user-acceptance, end-to-end,\\nintegration and unit results keep their distinct claims and coordinates\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md#EXECUTIVE_BASELINE%2F11.%20Derived%20generic%20specialist%20frame%20set%2FRelation%20to%20the%20testing%20and%20interface%20frames\",\"start_line\":1113}],\"label\":\"Product testing frames\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-