ncies and workspace. Engagement frames organise finite specialist evaluations; they do not contain the complete Product or workspace. Operational full coverage retains unknown, uncovered, conditional, conflicted and authority-excluded residuals.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1378,\"path\":\"standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md\",\"quote\":\"The Executive derives the complete known evaluation inventory from the\\nselected method members, the project domain, the outcome, history,\\ndependencies and the workspace.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md#EXECUTIVE_BASELINE%2F14.%20Coverage%20application\",\"start_line\":1374}],\"label\":\"Known evaluation inventory and coverage\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"objects","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:7e0e873e6fcb53c802e77f7e3547b545","key":251,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:7e0e873e6fcb53c802e77f7e3547b545\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"sort\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:sort:authored-concept\",\"value\":{\"conditions\":[],\"definition\":\"Bounded missing-frame diagnosis accepts closed out_of_frame, indeterminate or invalid_basis results identifying the missing relation, coordinate, evidence, authority, capability or interaction that can change evaluation. The Executive applies all eight REFERENCE_FRAME §10 diagnostic questions in order before adding or revising a frame.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1396,\"path\":\"standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md\",\"quote\":\"in that order, all of them. This profile adds two readings and no question\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md#EXECUTIVE_BASELINE%2F15.%20Missing-frame%20and%20re-entry%20application\",\"start_line\":1395}],\"label\":\"Missing-frame diagnosis and re-entry\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"objects","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:236e17b7b4d8474dafec83596485f535","key":252,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:236e17b7b4d8474dafec83596485f535\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"sort\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:sort:authored-concept\",\"value\":{\"conditions\":[],\"definition\":\"Optional executive profile configuration. Product adoption and admission of the configuration's material decisions are separate relations: method-cut inclusion makes the profile available; Product authority adopts it; the smallest existing authority owning each material decision admits that decision's configuration.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1429,\"path\":\"standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md\",\"quote\":\"Two relations stay apart here.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-commo