:source-first-proposal","family":"objects","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:5a10a0f1f401ec83baeec723320f3ada","key":301,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:5a10a0f1f401ec83baeec723320f3ada\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"sort\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:sort:authored-concept\",\"value\":{\"conditions\":[],\"definition\":\"Locator category urn:stdo:bounded-context:reference-frame-evaluation, declared by REFERENCE_FRAME §1. Its cited import declaration holds FOUNDATIONS §2 frame/ontology/authority/disjointness/tuple objects, FOUNDATIONS §4 results and conjunction, ACTIVATION step/refinements/closed result, and EVALUATION qualification, each retaining its owner. FOUNDATIONS.md#frame-objects owns Reference Frame/Frame, Activated Frame, Evaluation, Evaluation Family, Workspace, Material-Relation Manifold, Coordinate, Topology, Capability Envelope, Frame Set, Active Frame Configuration, Lens, Role, Persona, Abstraction and Component; #the-frame-tuple owns Frame Tuple; #authority-kinds owns Actor Identity. REFERENCE_FRAME owns Frame Declaration at #minimal-frame-declaration, Frame-Set Declaration at #4-frame-set-declaration, Activation Packet at #11-the-activation-packet, Engagement Atom/Semantic Atom at #engagement-atom-and-semantic-atom, Communication at #rf-009-no-assumed-hierarchy, and Coverage Ledger/statuses at #coverage-ledger. Method-function outcome locators at #5-method-functions enumerate activate: activated_frame, activation_refusal(capability/authority/basis); conjoin: decision(holds), decision(fails), conflict, indeterminate; translate: translated_value, declared_loss, refusal(condition/authority/basis). Coverage statuses are covered, separately_covered, excluded_by_authority, conditionally_covered, conflicted, uncovered, unknown. FOUNDATIONS Results owns Result Algebra, its five values, non-performance, refinement and parent-value terms; Conjunction owns conjunction, declared decision rule and composition of results. ACTIVATION owns size measurement at §2; admission/activation values activated, admission_refused(authority/basis), closure_unresolved; construction availability candidate_ready, refused, incomplete, re_entry_requested(authority/basis); disposition accept, local_repair, re_enter, reject; ambiguity resolved, carried, escalated, blocked; effects completed, not_effected, completion_unknown; and Closed Result at §7. EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md#11-derived-generic-specialist-frame-set owns Product and Owner specialist frame families. These categories and values remain locator data, with no inferred mappings.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":170,\"path\":\"standards/GLOSSARY.md\",\"quote\":\"Its import declaration,\\n[Imports into this context](REFERENCE_FRAME.md#imports-into-this-context),\\nholds in the context the frame objects, ontology objects, authority kinds,\\ndisjointness and frame tuple of FOUNDATIONS §2, the core results and their\\nconjunction of FOUNDATIONS §4, the step with its result refinements and\\nthe closed result of ACTIVATION §1 to §3 and §7, and the qualification of\\nEVALUATION §7, each kept by its owner. A row for an imported concept cites\\nits owning section as owning concept clause and the import declaration as\\nrelation clause (§2; P1, P6).\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/GLOSSARY.md#GLOSSARY%2F8.%20Reference-frame%20evaluation\",\"start_line\":162},{\"end_line\":200,\"path\":\"standards/GLOSSARY.md\",\"quote\":\"| effects: `completed`; `not_effected`; `completion_unknown` | `urn:st