scharged by each break.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":984,\"path\":\"standards/TICKETS.md\",\"quote\":\"a\\n`Break-To-Closure Map` stating which break closes which closure-law clause;\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/TICKETS.md#TICKETS%2F6.%20Implementation%20migration%2FBreak%20order%20and%20break-to-closure%20map\",\"start_line\":983}],\"label\":\"Migration break order and closure map\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"objects","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:5709d600fd5dda035a513b9a6af281e8","key":533,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:5709d600fd5dda035a513b9a6af281e8\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"sort\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:sort:authored-concept\",\"value\":{\"conditions\":[],\"definition\":\"Assessment independent of the author of the exact reviewed subject, with subject, basis, scope, exclusions, evidence, verdict and unresolved findings identified. Authoring authority and independent verification authority differ.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1044,\"path\":\"standards/TICKETS.md\",\"quote\":\"Authority to author or implement a change is not independent authority to\\nverify it.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/TICKETS.md#TICKETS%2F7.%20Authority%2C%20judg