ng:preserves_applicable_obligations_of\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"qualifiers\":{\"conditions\":[\"The destination's obligations apply to the transition.\"],\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":141,\"path\":\"standards/ACTIVATION.md\",\"quote\":\"Each\\ntransition binds the obligations it must preserve: the outer obligations\\nof the destination and of the governing relations it affects, as far as\\nthey apply to it.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/ACTIVATION.md#ACTIVATION%2F1.%20The%20step%2FTransitions\",\"start_line\":138}],\"kind\":\"preserves_applicable_obligations_of\",\"meaning\":\"A transition must bind and preserve applicable outer destination obligations, together with affected governing-relation obligations.\"},\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"source\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:3d3b5c6c2d3f3cc4fc6c364bdbb9d934\",\"target\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:757947ab4358af48fb6a8afcb14ab842\"}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"relations","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:cc5ebd188ebff1956d0fd0cd1a413b0c","key":673,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:cc5ebd188ebff1956d0fd0cd1a413b0c\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:relation-kind:governing:requires_binding_of\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"qualifiers\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":215,\"path\":\"standards/ACTIVATION.md\",\"quote\":\"Binding A and Z. A construction binds A, the current state of Transitions\\nabove with its account, and Z, the destination as a predicate over\\nrealised states that includes the acceptance conditions of the selected\\noutcome. The account of A describes the material workspace state, the\\nrelevant external observations acquired through the interfaces that own\\nthem, what is justifiably known and the explicit unknowns; an actor's\\nacquired account can be incomplete or stale, and the workspace, not the\\naccount, is the subject (§5).\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/ACTIVATION.md#ACTIVATION%2F1.%20The%20step%2FConstruction%20relation\",\"start_line\":208}],\"kind\":\"requires_binding_of\",\"meaning\":\"Construction binds actual current state A and its fallible account without replacing the workspace subject with the account.\"},\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"source\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:32042b38168b865f15b179aa395cf70f\",\"target\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:bf286579d4e585eb06b3157fadd71330\"}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"relations","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:96549665dabf5b4715b0c424966bb255","key":674,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:96549665dabf5b4715b0c424966bb255\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:relation-kind:governing:requires_binding_of\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"qualifiers\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":211,\"path\":\"standards/ACTIVATION.md\",\"quote\":\"Binding A and Z. A construction binds A, the current state of Transitions\\nabove with its account, and Z, the destination as a predicate over\\nrealised states that includes the acceptance conditions of the selected\\noutcome.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/ACTIVATION.md#ACTIVATION%2F1.%20The%20step%2FConstruction%20relation\",\"start_line\":208}],\"kind\":\"requires_binding_of\",\"meaning\":\"Construction binds the outcome predicate Z with acceptance conditions; calculus lawfulness cannot select or establish that outcome.\"},\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"source\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:32042b38168b865f15b179aa395cf70f\",\"target\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:757947ab4358af48fb6a8afcb14ab842\"}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"relations","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:c0fcebaf9aea2b519a6066de7671c236","key":675,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:c0fcebaf9aea2b519a6066de7671c236\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:relation-kind:governing:necessary_condition_for\",\"owner\":\"