ic and operational evaluation; discovery does not itself decide reuse or separation.\"},\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"source\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:8e5e05d12a032d36a117b5f56176885c\",\"target\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:efb9ff5d3635a7b82d3288c918fc04d1\"}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"relations","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:60dc0c2a49bca07af817af302c4e0386","key":718,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:60dc0c2a49bca07af817af302c4e0386\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:relation-kind:discovery:optional_theoretical_justification\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"qualifiers\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[\"The framing may be irrelevant, unavailable or candidate-class.\"],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1713,\"path\":\"standards/DESIGN_MODULE.md\",\"quote\":\"The framing sharpens the ask; it does not expand the\\nscope of the profile\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/DESIGN_MODULE.md#DESIGN_MODULE%2F8.%20Theoretical%20framing\",\"start_line\":1712}],\"kind\":\"optional_theoretical_justification\",\"meaning\":\"The Markov-object analogy explains the engineering profile without governing its use or adding prerequisites.\"},\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"source\":\"urn:a-c:generation:065785