te\":\"Task frames own no determination. Check their current source bindings and\\nacquire missing deciding owner sections under ACTIVATION §2; do not treat a\\nroute as proof that the frame is sufficient for every task.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/plugins/spec/references/REFRESH.md#STDO%20Refresh%20Procedure%2FOwner%20And%20Task%20Entries\",\"start_line\":70}],\"statement\":\"Load listed bundle members in order; unsectioned members in full and selected sections in full including subsections until the next heading of equal or shallower level. Narrower owner/task acquisition does not change the complete basis. Accept owner names only from verified standards inventory; the method entry locates scope. Select a task entry when sufficient because full-owner reads have cost. Task frames own no determination: check source currency and acquire missing deciding sections under ACTIVATION §2; route availability proves no universal sufficiency.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:601d274c8132a08ea12213de3d9a9a6a","key":869,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:8fcb544c45e9cba3d183ecc9730c7830\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:601d274c8132a08ea12213de3d9a9a6a\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[\"Explicit candidate mode uses the explicitly selected package and carries no released-consumer standing.\"],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":98,\"path\":\"plugins/spec/references/REFRESH.md\",\"quote\":\"2. Resolve the selected entry and each of its members and sections using\\n   [Product Basis Selection](PRODUCT_BASIS.md#read-a-member-from-that-basis),\\n   checking the manifest, member digest and anchor. Candidate mode uses the\\n   explicitly selected package and carries no released-consumer standing. Refuse\\n   unknown names and any fallback to a different install, local copy,\\n   mutable source, or nearby Product.\\n3. For each listed member or section, in order, read and surface it in full\\n   with its name, exact basis, resolved source, full content, and explicit\\n   end marker.\\n4. Conclude:\\n\\n   ```text\\n   Active context: <name> from <basis>. The complete selected basis remains constitutional authority.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/plugins/spec/references/REFRESH.md#STDO%20Refresh%20Procedure%2FProcedure\",\"start_line\":86}],\"statement\":\"Resolve exactly one basis: installed requires one definition and verified URI/manifest; release resolves product-local cut via manager with possibly project-qualified Git transport and no moving-selector substitution. Candidate emits '[CANDIDATE] Mutable STDO authoring source loaded. This is not released consumer law.' Resolve entries/members/sections with manifest, digest and anchor checks; refuse unknown names and fallback to another install, local copy, mutable source or nearby Product. Surface every selected member/section in order and in full with name, exact basis, resolved source, full content and end marker. Conclude with the stated Active context message retaining complete-basis constitutional authority, read subject to candidate's explicit non-operative status. Multiple explicit calls may build multi-document context; daily skills should normally read the smallest relevant surface.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The final authority wording is not explicitly specialized for candidate mode; its interaction is retained as a residual.\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:007052be5262652c532bf821c5779b26","key":870,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:3d1b7e8fd94b6a13e7036881a685a062\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:007052be5262652c532bf821c5779b26\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[\"On a selection stop, only read-only re-entry or setup guidance may be returned.\"],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":17,\"path\":\"plugins/spec/skills/stdo-hel