ls/stdo-status/SKILL.md#STDO%20Status%2FSelect%20The%20Product%20Basis\",\"start_line\":14}],\"statement\":\"Apply Product Basis Selection before status reporting; continue only from exactly one verified selection and remain read-only.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:b1f7ce0b30b8ad3729e1bb6cd3293e53","key":879,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:6b63054663984bff3aa30721243fa32e\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:b1f7ce0b30b8ad3729e1bb6cd3293e53\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[\"Separate authorization is required for ticket creation, reprioritization, status mutation or disposition.\"],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":33,\"path\":\"plugins/spec/skills/stdo-status/SKILL.md\",\"quote\":\"   Resolve each reported ticket to its unique current authoritative carrier,\\n   including a referenced peer ticket. A historical link, predecessor section\\n   or another ticket's summary cannot establish its current lane or admission.\\n   If the carrier is unavailable, report that state as unverified or omit the\\n   adjacent claim. Distinguish the starting source commit from the later\\n   admission record and the candidate/evidence checkpoint; do not assign an\\n   uncommitted decision to the starting commit.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/plugins/spec/skills/stdo-status/SKILL.md#STDO%20Status%2FProcedure\",\"start_line\":27},{\"end_line\":62,\"path\":\"plugins/spec/skills/stdo-status/SKILL.md\",\"quote\":\"For an interrupted or refused operation, report the requested outcome,\\nobserved effect state and the effect owner's retry rule separately, as the\\nreconciliation of uncertain external effects in ACTIVATION §5 requires. No observed\\neffect alone does not mean the request is complete or that retry is needed.\\nKeep unknown effects unknown and withhold repetition until its rule permits it.\\nFor completion, evaluate satisfied obligations, current evidence, required\\njudgments/rulings and active non-closure conditions. Report missing conditions\\nwithout making a fresh review an automatic gate.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/plugins/spec/skills/stdo-status/SKILL.md#STDO%20Status%2FProcedure\",\"start_line\":55}],\"statement\":\"From verified definition read Goals, bound lanes/outcome, exact checkpoint/workspace, accepted design, proof and exact reviews; comments/dashboards are projections. Acquire under ACTIVATION §2 and use §5 for state/resumption. Resolve every reported ticket, including peers, to its unique current authoritative carrier; historical links/predecessors/other summaries establish neither lane nor admission. If unavailable report unverified or omit adjacent claim. Keep starting commit, later admission and evidence checkpoint distinct; do not attach uncommitted decisions to starting commit. Compare only against a user baseline, accepted checkpoint or prior durable state; absent one report current state without invented delta. Actual tools/carriers supply identities/state/freshness; unavailable outputs stay unknown, sufficiency is separate judgment, and integrity proves no work truth. Reuse applicable rulings/judgments; resume refreshes changed inputs/affected results only. Separate accepted movement, active construction, prerequisite readiness, preservation/regression, rejected/superseded churn, blockers, uncertainty, drift and next authorized action. Triage may propose smallest re-entry but not mutate. Separate technical triage from Product priority/boundary effect using bound scales/cutoff/hard stops; counts/prose imply no completion percentage. Recovery separates request, effects and retry rule; unknown effects remain unknown and repetition waits for permission under that rule. Completion checks obligations, evidence, rulings and non-closure conditions without automatic fresh review.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:48888fa6e6e8d5043b5096dea51a5f07","key":880,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:6b63054663984bff3aa30721243fa32e\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:48888fa6e6e8d5043b5096dea51a5f07\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":71,\"path\":\"plugins/spec/skills/stdo-status/SKILL.md\",\"quote\":\"Lead with Product outcome and current boundary. Report basis health, completed\\nsince the comparison point, current work/evidence, blockers/findings, proposed\\ntriage or decisions, and one next already-authorized action. State stale,\\nmissing, or unverified evidence. Keep adjacent observations from becoming\\nautomatic release blockers; when a finding blocks promotion is decided by\\nEVALUATION §5 When a finding blocks promotion.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/plugins/spec/skills/stdo-status/SKILL.md#STDO%20Status%2FReturn\",\"start_line\":66}],\"statement\":\"Lead with Product outcome/boundary; report basis health, completion since actual comparison point, current work/evidence, blockers/findings, proposed triage/decisions and one already-authorized next action. Identify stale/missing/unverified evidence. Adjacent observations are not automatic release blockers; EVALUATION §5 owns promotion blocking.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:a9d8a96c5b843d27fae37797287c7b70","key":881,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:effbef4bb67c2a61fe9f289cf9efa2dc\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:a9d8a96c5b843d27fae37797287c7b70\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":15,\"path\":\"plugins/spec/skills/stdo-ticket/SKILL.md\",\"quote\":\"Read and apply\\n[`PRODUCT_BASIS.md`](../../references/PRODUCT_BASIS.md) before proposing or\\nmutating ticket state. Continue only from its exactly-one verified selection;\\nthat selection grants no ticket-state authority.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/plugins/spec/skills/stdo-ticket/SKILL.md#STDO%20Ticket%2FSelect%20The%20Product%20Basis\",\"start_line\":12}],\"statement\":\"Apply Product Basis Selection before proposing or mutating ticket state; exactly-one verified selection is required but grants no ticket-state authority.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:ed88d2227866eb95cd9f8e1dd3ad7fe0","key":882,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:effbef4bb67c2a61fe9f289cf9efa2dc\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:ed88d2227866eb95cd9f8e1dd3ad7fe0\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":30,\"path\":\"plugins/spec/skills/stdo-ticket/SKILL.md\",\"quote\":\"2. Confirm explicit authority to create or update ticket state. Without it,\\n   return proposed triage and stop without writing.\\n3. Create or update a durable ticket only when the work or an open obligation\\n   needs independent identity, handoff, dependency, reopening, repricing, or\\n   closure beyond its admitted sprint or, when no sprint applies, beyond the\\n   current run, or when the user explicitly requests that durable record. Do\\n   not create a ticket merely because execution needs a run-scoped contract.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/plugins/spec/skills/stdo-ticket/SKILL.md#STDO%20Ticket%2FProcedure\",\"start_line\":24}],\"statement\":\"Read verified Goals/Intent/Product, affected requirements/design, ticket bindings and existing work; acquire owners via ACTIVATION §2, SPEC_METHOD §4 triage/classes and TICKETS §4 fields. Require explicit ticket mutation authority or return proposed triage without writes. Durable tickets require independent identity/handoff/dependency/reopening/repricing/closure beyond admitted sprint or otherwise run, or an explicit durable-record request; run contracts alone do not require tickets. Determine affected boundary/first changed layer from available computed routes, complete Public membership/value comparison and design trace; retain missing mappings/evidence as unknown, reuse valid classification and record residual judgment/support once. Nonconformance does not choose requirement repricing. Select smallest lawful one of six change classes; exact Product policy supplies type/category, with base types feature/bug/spike/chore and categories ordinary/implementation_migration. Resolve lanes and make one unique ticket with exactly id/title/type/ticket_category/status/goal/change_intent/change_class/re_entry_point/triaged_at/created_at/updated_at. Admission adds target_truth, relevant superseded_truth, closure_law, evaluation_criteria, non_closure_conditions, proof_surface and applicable boundary/authority/dependencies/source-ticket/build-tenant. Ticket is only a contract-source candidate; report drafted unless independently evidenced deterministic admission or exact human override. Creation, lane and active status do not admit. Summaries stay subordinate; priority requires Product policy/authority and cannot be copied from Reviewer severity.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:99e897ea7f5544d388fcca4e0c06e637","key":883,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:effbef4bb67c2a61fe9f289cf9efa2dc\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:99e897ea7f5544d388fcca4e0c06e637\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[\"A state update or repricing is authorized.\"],\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":81,\"path\":\"plugins/spec/skills/stdo-ticket/SKILL.md\",\"quote\":\"Use this ticket's existing proof/result routes; do not create a judgment registry.\\nWhen repricing, give each affected obligation a retained, superseded, deferred\\nor withdrawn disposition with its owner and applicable evidence. Preserve\\nsurviving work and changed dependencies without duplicating unaffected history.\\nPresent a short consequence delta for the owner decision; a general instruction\\nto continue does not accept undisclosed architecture or scope changes.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/plugins/spec/skills/stdo-ticket/SKILL.md#STDO%20Ticket%2FProcedure\",\"start_line\":76}],\"statement\":\"Evaluate closure from satisfied obligations, valid applicable evidence, required judgments/rulings and no active non-closure condition; required review checks evidence but its occurrence is not closure. Store reusable judgment question, subject/basis, support, actor/authority, conclusion, uncertainty and revising observation through existing proof/result routes, with original rulings separate and only affected support invalidated under ACTIVATION §7; create no judgment registry. Repricing gives every affected obligation retained/superseded/deferred/withdrawn disposition with owner/evidence, preserves surviving work and changed dependencies, avoids duplicating unaffected history, and presents a short consequence delta. General continuation does not accept undisclosed architecture or scope change.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:9a11abc53d1e9cb0e68ffe78a0a81101","key":884,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:effbef4bb67c2a61fe9f289cf9efa2dc\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:9a11abc53d1e9cb0e68ffe78a0a81101\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[\"Requirements/design/code/test edits require separate execution authorization.\"],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":89,\"path\":\"plugins/spec/skills/stdo-ticket/SKILL.md\",\"quote\":\"Return the ticket path and compact triage: boundary, change class, re-entry\\npoint, scope, target truth, closure law, non-closure conditions, proof surface,\\nderived execution-contract state and evidence, and next decision. Do not edit\\nrequirements, design, code, or tests unless the u