on's declared bootstrap entrypoint. Then\\nacquire what this work needs under the selected basis's `ACTIVATION.md`\\nsection 2, Acquisition: a derived surface whose sources are current where one\\nserves the task, such as a verbatim frame of the cut, and otherwise the owning\\nsections that decide the task's questions. Acquire only from the exact\\nselected basis; a candidate source, a version-line selector or another basis\\nis no substitute. Acquisition is read-only and grants no role, operation or\\ndecision; effectful work still needs the admitted contract below. Before\\ndependent action, return a missing binding (no available frame declaring what\\nthe evaluation needs, or an absent or unverifiable basis) with the outcome\\nthat section names.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/plugins/spec/skills/stdo-work/SKILL.md#STDO%20Work%2FAcquire%20The%20Deciding%20Owners\",\"start_line\":20}],\"statement\":\"Enter verified bootstrap, then acquire exact-basis current derived surfaces when sufficient or deciding owner sections otherwise, under ACTIVATION §2. Candidate source/version-line selector/another basis cannot substitute. Acquisition is read-only and grants no role/operation/decision; effects need admitted contracts. Before dependent action return missing declaring-frame or absent/unverifiable-basis binding with the owner section's named outcome.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The acquisition owner's exact missing-binding outcome is outside supplied text.\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa4845