cable Product/graph/language/runtime/handler/module law has pass, fail or reasoned not_applicable; relied-on semantic_not_realized constructors block promotion/closure. Ask whether proportional sequencing is justified and design accepted before promotion/closure and, where design-gated, before retained implementation establishes unresolved/contradictory relations or non-equivalent networks; one accepted Ontology precedes IACS/public-operation/schema/module/implementation promotion; entities, identities, relationships, invariants and lifecycle are enumerated without default mutable CRUD; each function/transition declares applicable proposer/evaluator/verifier/admitter/executor/projector/retirement authority separately from actor/capability; every functionality item is atomically derived, composed, deferred, excluded or assigned a gap; Prime contraction covers the entire atom family and projections with admitted domains; composition/effect algebra proves applicable identity, closure, cardinality, effect and authority conservation; all downstream surfaces trace to Ontology with accepted loss declared; removing Ontology exposes no ungrounded downstream meaning.\",\"uncertainty\":\"Graph carriers, Prime/IACS rules and the canonical lifecycle are referenced but not fully defined here.\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:edec7622ef0c9689bdf8d00aa839231c","key":1107,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:0793e8125983