ptance where required.\",\"uncertainty\":\"These are ownership assignments; detailed imported laws are not supplied.\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:425d75c63db5fbd9f7b7941861a01cc6","key":1147,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:491378d3b3b4015b2d90d884ace55ff3\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:425d75c63db5fbd9f7b7941861a01cc6\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[\"Finishing as Writer is allowed only when the local outcome is sufficient, no independent assessment is required and no acceptance is reserved.\"],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":176,\"path\":\"standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md\",\"quote\":\"- the direct route binds the same exact intake, operation territory,\\n  applicable obligations, evidence, stop conditions and declared result\\n  consumer as the coordinated route of §12; and\\n- a direct Worker (Writer) gains no review, ticket, diagram recreation or\\n  owner ceremony from using this profile.\",\"section