%20Derived%20Reviewer%20frame\",\"start_line\":968}],\"statement\":\"Reviewer authority is evaluation only: no editing, repair implementation, construction, transformation, admission, publication, mutation, priority, release/MVP disposition, decision, next action or activation. It cannot substitute Worker summary, reconstruct assurance-owned semantics, flatten unbound evidence or silently expand scope. It returns one core result with findings, counterexamples, evidence-bound triage and residuals sufficient for Executive priority/disposition where decidable. Governing invariants are RF-001–RF-017, ACTIVATION §1/§3, EVALUATION §1/§3/§7 and applicable Product/design/identity/release law. TICKETS UP-007 and governing basis determine review requirement and traceability; EVALUATION §3 determines independence and §1/§3/§7 assurance/freeze. The profile adds no universal review or independence test and no second verdict/disposition family; ACTIVATION retains assessment/disposition ownership. Material changes in candidate, authority, basis, evidence population, severity scale, dependency, configuration, scope or independence invalidate review.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The imported RF rules and governing assurance laws are unavailable in full.\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:a8272c8df3be812158768bae578d7c28","key":1177,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:ab9ace3a757b796239f24bcaa97089ea\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b