triage.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:a86a1595acf030446ed797b63fb8ffbb","key":1178,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:77d30851030c0160e2eef6173a7ceb06\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:a86a1595acf030446ed797b63fb8ffbb\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[\"A specialist instance is activated.\"],\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1025,\"path\":\"standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md\",\"quote\":\"An adopting project binds, for every activated\\ninstance, the exact subject, basis, material manifold, coordinates,\\ninvariants, authority, evidence, exclusions, result algebra, capability\\nenvelope, dependencies and invalidation conditions\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md#EXECUTIVE_BASELINE%2F11.%20Derived%20generic%20specialist%20frame%20set\",\"start_line\":1014}],\"statement\":\"Every activated instance binds exact subject, basis, manifold, coordinates, invariants, authority, evidence, exclusions, result algebra, capability envelope, dependencies and invalidation. Every material cross-context seam requires an explicit relation. Topology gives Product no rank over Design; existing Product authority already owns constitutional meaning. A broader Owner frame gains no authority over Entity or Operator, and Proof gains no Reviewer, acceptance or disposition authority. The existing authority graph governs.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:021f02bba8d0b072658aa7cb023c424e","key":1179,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:23038c5196954649dd285668c81f61e5\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:222b55dcc370296e9bb36bc1dc80201e\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:9d585aa7dc7ed5a4197a9b0c226a5f95\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:6900795317794a3dcc20bb1d7891460d\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:69c333f3efd4e5ce102210b4b235bb3e\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:941a824869107d7baca278d90ab06ef1\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:4b5563aede38ec1b0556b28c86686f46\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:3d9fe324dacbe1da3e04a3687c9baa0d\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:947c47a774691fe5e5e5a9b6ea87947b\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:fa2428a2b6a