d assurance basis (EVALUATION §3 and §7), the Product-selected severity scale and the required technical-triage capability |\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/EXECUTIVE_BASELINE.md#EXECUTIVE_BASELINE%2F19.%20Baseline-specific%20basis%20and%20activation%20additions%2FActivation%20additions\",\"start_line\":1678}],\"statement\":\"First carry REFERENCE_FRAME §11 generic minimal binding. Worker binding is also sufficient ACTIVATION §1 intake plus applicable exact inherited operation grant/subject/territory. Reviewer adds exact claim, composition boundary, population, oracle, ordinary/module path, falsification condition, independence/assurance basis, Product severity and technical-triage capability. Executive adds current Product-role map, MVP/release mandate, evaluation frontier, closed-result/triage ledger, priority/boundary policy, conjunction and exact disposition grant.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The generic binding's full external definition is not supplied.\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:ff8e5d78d7c2e399223a520ca61fa27e","key":1200,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:4cf9bc8bd98b23b5fc036cefad9bae4d\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:ff8e5d78d7c2e399223a520ca61fa27e