ome→flattened unevaluated higher-level claim; correct output through obsolete/bypass path→path falsification; UAT private API/injected state/hidden admin/test endpoint→invalid subject/path; sunny path claimed combinatorial→undeclared population/residuals; unjustified pairwise for authority/persistence/recovery/migration/historical multi-boundary failures→insufficient strength/invalid basis; successor green with old exports/consumers/fallbacks/proof→unproved deletion/exclusion; negative test overwrites frozen install→invalidated subject/missing isolation; moving tree/rebuilt artifact review→invalid exact-subject basis; flattened episodes/stores→missing translation/binding; Worker continues after self-review→decision/continuation violation; Reviewer fixes while retaining verdict→independence/authority violation; Reviewer priority/block/repair/activation→decision bleed; Executive merges severity/priority/verdict/block→triage collapse and reapply Product policy; Executive rewrites semantics→outside proxy/re-entry; repeated repair creates rival authority→incomplete cone or missing owner/capability; long effort resets after local success→coverage/altitude/topology/evidence/capability diagnosis.\",\"uncertainty\":\"Routes identify candidate diagnoses; they are not adjudicated results.\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:edc41aa4276582de08ff5595d3046c14","key":1201,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:236e17b7b4d84