ODUCT_DEFINITION%2F10.%20Semantic-resolution%20conformance%20cases\",\"start_line\":851}],\"statement\":\"A positive local case declares one context and resolves exactly one concept; a positive cross-context case supplies the complete authorised relation. Negative cases include zero candidates, remaining multiplicity after disambiguation, selection outside candidates, context-free glossary fallback, incomplete coordinates, authority/basis mismatch, undeclared loss and invalidation. Correct downstream behaviour based on guessed meaning does not pass. CONFORMANCE may index but cannot redefine these cases.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:a94457222f1c7c65337ef1c6f50e3e1c","key":1324,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:70f67311f73a19765787897dfa4176f1\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:05c1a265f04949108de6c22b4ed5d7b2\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:a94457222f1c7c65337ef1c6f50e3e1c\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":881,\"path\":\"standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md\",\"quote\":\"Within their declared scope, derived instructions preserve the owning\\nclauses' applicability, obligations, permissions, exclusions, decision\\nowners and invalidators. A projected prohibition cannot lose its condition\\nor its lawful alternative, even when every source digest is correct. A\\nsummary, bootstrap or index cannot require a stricter or weaker relation by\\ncompression. Its references are resolvable within the declared actor's\\naccess; otherwise the required meaning is supplied directly (P4b, P1;\\nFOUNDATIONS §4, reference versus body).\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#PRODUCT_DEFINITION%2F11.%20One%20constitutional%20surface%20and%20version%20boundary\",\"start_line\":874}],\"statement\":\"Derived surfaces cannot become selectable partial constitutions or reinterpret owners. Within scope they preserve applicability, obligations, permissions, exclusions, decision owners and invalidators, including a prohibition's condition and lawful alternative even with correct digests. Compression cannot strengthen or weaken a relation. References must resolve within declared actor access; otherwise supply required meaning directly.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:2b05a991d658921005fad1762101e3bb","key":1325,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","p