re-acceptance. Raw owning members of the same selected cut decide questions a stale or insufficient carrier cannot decide. Matching digests alone do not establish semantic preservation.\",\"uncertainty\":\"ACTIVATION §2 owns the general staleness and standalone-scope laws; EVALUATION §7 supplies additional digest/qualification context not supplied here.\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:8193ab387aaa96f02a970a8032832eed","key":1326,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:70f67311f73a19765787897dfa4176f1\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:95866066e6bc25e27771686a22cc6e9e\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:8193ab387aaa96f02a970a8032832eed\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[],\"exceptions\":[\"A concrete form is method law when explicitly accepted by the method as an interoperability boundary, as claimed for the definition schema and template in §1.\",\"Separate explicit human authorisation can authorise executable or consumer Product scope.\"],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":917,\"path\":\"standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md\",\"quote\":\"A shared-method amendment cannot create an executable tool, workflow\\nengine, runtime, assurance system or consumer realisation as STDO Product\\nscope without separate explicit human authorisation. An agent recording a\\nruling cannot widen its subject, implication, authority or change class\\n(P6).\\n\\nOnly a released method version is publication authority. Mutable method\\nsource may author a future cut; it must not silently govern a consumer\\n(P6, P3).\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#PRODUCT_DEFINITION%2F11.%20One%20constitutional%20surface%20and%20version%20boundary\",\"start_line\":909}],\"statement\":\"Maintain method/consumer ownership separation. A shared-method amendment alone cannot establish an executable tool, workflow engine, runtime, assurance system or consumer realisation as STDO Product scope. Recording a ruling cannot widen its subject, implication, authority or change class. Mutable source may author a future cut but cannot silently govern consumers; publication authority belongs only to a released version.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:03870fd596139d563dfeb4bdb029d751","key":1327,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:3add3b1f83bc954a23767c8b23298c71\",\"urn:a-c: