:\"- when a module realises a non-UX surface, only DESIGN_MODULE applies, and\\n  its design module ignores this profile;\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/UX.md#UX%2F2.%20Role%20and%20composition\",\"start_line\":163}],\"statement\":\"UX refines rather than duplicates DESIGN_MODULE: parent-governed immutability, totality, effect edges, no semantic centre and coupling remain parent law; UX extends render lifecycle, browser events, layout and accessibility. For a UX module, both apply and its design module reads both; for a non-UX module, only DESIGN_MODULE applies and UX is ignored. A graph-execution Product projection/query surface including UX follows UX realization law. Graph execution determines Product graph-native shape, DESIGN_MODULE module discipline, UX additional surface discipline.\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:8b6e2f6ba6a000bcf40842dc546ff52f","key":1567,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:7a9d378573708e829488aa2ffbb49efa\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:593429f1fa25b744fdcf828e4235cd1c\",\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:a5c323426e83c24d36ee5025b541da67\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record