aterial evaluation.\"],\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":78,\"path\":\"standards/templates/PROJECT_REFERENCE_FRAME_BASIS_TEMPLATE.md\",\"quote\":\"Determine applicable evaluations from their owners, not only a caller's list,\\nunder `ACTIVATION.md` section 1, Applicability, which states what a false or\\nunknown predicate does. Retain every required constraining result in the\\ndeclared conjunction. Frame availability alone does not activate it.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/templates/PROJECT_REFERENCE_FRAME_BASIS_TEMPLATE.md#Project%20Reference-Frame%20Basis%2FEvaluation%20Inventory\",\"start_line\":75}],\"statement\":\"Record stable evaluation identity/provenance, exact subject/basis, required result algebra, material frame family/declaration, dependencies/affected Product edges, planning disposition activate|non_material|residual, non-material evidence or residual and re-entry condition, owning applicability predicate and true/false/unknown premises, required-result identity and satisfied/missing/invalid evidence. Determine applicability from owners rather than only caller lists; retain every required constraining result in the declared conjunction. Frame availability alone does not activate it.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The consequences of false and unknown applicability are delegated to unsupplied ACTIVATION section 1; neither is inferred here.\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:dbe0bca336a890bfac4bbfe105d93d44","key":1667,"owner":"urn:a-c:ge