nder%20an%20envelope\",\"start_line\":755}],\"statements\":[\"When context does not fit, combine contract refinement into fitting steps, sequenced activations, lawful compression preserving evaluation distinctions and failure detection, another fitting actor, or out_of_frame.\",\"Within its grant, a step selects refinement, sequencing and compression.\",\"Another actor or a larger envelope requires owner re-entry unless that choice was delegated in the grant.\",\"Assess a recorded compression-preservation claim independently only where its served promotion requires independent assessment.\"]},\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:6e08c1219e2615bd98a4b4349eacb927\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"forbidden_variation\":{\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":771,\"path\":\"standards/ACTIVATION.md\",\"quote\":\"Silent\\n   omission to fit is never one of them\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/ACTIVATION.md#ACTIVATION%2F2.%20Context%20construction%20under%20an%20envelope\",\"start_line\":755}],\"statements\":[\"Silent omission to fit.\",\"Silently narrowing the required predicate or preserved obligations; narrowing is an owner-controlled destination change.\",\"Hiding undecided matters; they remain explicit unknowns.\",\"Claiming compression preservation without recording compression and its preservation argument.\"]},\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:79025b37c4767fe27a53b42588986f80\",\"invalidation\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:invalidation:source-or-interpretation-change\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn