ete assurance workflow or binding is inferred.\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:d1dfd121f017458b93ec3428078aca1d\",\"invalidation\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:invalidation:source-or-interpretation-change\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:residual-kind:authored-uncertainty\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"re_entry\":[],\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"subject\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:2da4e83034810764ae2685c55dc4f3cc\",\"uncertainty\":{\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1754,\"path\":\"standards/DESIGN_MODULE.md\",\"quote\":\"the binding declared at the head of this\\nmember\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/DESIGN_MODULE.md#DESIGN_MODULE%2F9.%20Module%20taxonomy\",\"start_line\":1753}],\"statement\":\"The member-head binding and ASSURANCE §§14–16 are referenced but absent.\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"residuals","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:8924f3f53597b61d05df529f6844a5c4","key":1863,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"consequence\":\"The stated examples and affected-only invalidation are retained, without inventing a third invalidator or treating every new review as invalidation.\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:8924f3f53597b61d05df529f6844a5c4\",\"invalidati