 retained without a full process interpretation.\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"residuals","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:0ba19f15ea120b80b411ced13f92c04b","key":1906,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"consequence\":\"Retain the audit and source-coherence requirements as ordered prerequisites without deriving their complete checks from Graphify headings or unrelated references.\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:0ba19f15ea120b80b411ced13f92c04b\",\"invalidation\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:invalidation:source-or-interpretation-change\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:residual-kind:authored-uncertainty\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"re_entry\":[],\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"subject\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:e7edc30111d4c0953afc57895e74e66f\",\"uncertainty\":{\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":1685,\"path\":\"standards/ODD.md\",\"quote\":\"10. complete the execution-authority audit for the affected runtime,\\n    plugin, worker, event, projection, assurance, closure or continuation\\n    surfaces;\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/ODD.md#ODD%2F17.%20Invocation%20rule\",\"start_line\":1683}],\"statement\":\"ODD §11.5B execution-authority audit and §11.5C projection-source coherence are discovery leads but their text is not supplied.\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6f