absent; PRODUCT_DEFINITION §8 is supplied.\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"residuals","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:eee7e9fb803e91184438c735ce727847","key":1909,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"consequence\":\"Posting evidence or a proposal is not adoption; the incident-to-consumer propagation procedure remains unresolved rather than inferred.\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:eee7e9fb803e91184438c735ce727847\",\"invalidation\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:invalidation:source-or-interpretation-change\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:residual-kind:authored-uncertainty\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"re_entry\":[],\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"subject\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:c311423d514f30b594396b52d39f68c0\",\"uncertainty\":{\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":159,\"path\":\"standards/POSTING_GUIDE.md\",\"quote\":\"How a reusable method lesson travels from incident or review evidence to\\na consumer's realisation, STDO-UP-012, is stated once in\\n[SPEC_METHOD §6](SPEC_METHOD.md#shared-method-adoption-and-propagation-stdo-up-012).\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/POSTING_GUIDE.md#POSTING_GUIDE%2F10.%20Shared%20method%20adoption\",\"start_line\":157}],\"statement\":\"The owning STDO-UP-012 law in SPEC_METHOD §6 is not supplied.\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa