nal/method/release/assurance owners and PRODUCT_DEFINITION §§9–12 are not supplied.\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"residuals","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:b07b864e8cab795479ad61f334364afb","key":1911,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"consequence\":\"The family concepts and constraint retain source-stated premises, consequences and limits. Exact row-by-row proof standing, pillar links, added-choice allocations and the full §131–140 consumer-locus population require source re-entry; no external graph endpoints or verified derivations are created.\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:b07b864e8cab795479ad61f334364afb\",\"invalidation\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:invalidation:source-or-interpretation-change\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:residual-kind:authored-uncertainty\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"re_entry\":[],\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"subject\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:4650f9cc9cfd8d82c104f3c11bf25352\",\"uncertainty\":{\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":129,\"path\":\"standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md\",\"quote\":\"The standing of these consequences is stated in\\n[FOUNDATIONS §3 Foundation to law](FOUNDATIONS.md#foundation-to-law).\\nThe table accounts for §1 to §12 and for FOUNDATIONS §2 Imports between\\nmembers; the grounds of `out_of_frame` and `invalid_basis` stated there\\nare traced by family F3 at\\n[FOUNDATIONS §4 Results](FOUNDATIONS.md#results).\\n\\nConsumers of these rows, where an actor enters them (FOUNDATIONS §3\\nFoundation to law, Consumers), one list per row, each consumer linked to\\nits own locus:\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#PRODUCT_DEFINITION%2F1.%20Overlay%20and%20layout%20independence%2FFoundation%20to%20law%3A%20binding%20a%20project%20to%20the%20method\",\"start_line\":120}],\"statement\":\"The finite record set does not fully materialize the family table's derivational and consumer-index structure. Its external standing owner, most consumer loci and later member rules are unavailable.\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"residuals","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:be822c878516df1b058e80735547f841","key":1912,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis\",\"consequence\":\"Command boundaries, refusal conditions and canonical bytes are source-described obligations, not evidence that a concrete manager, store, manifest, plan or bootstrap satisfies them.\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:be822c878516df1b058e80735547f841\",\"invalidation\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:invalidation:source-or-interpretation-change\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:residual-kind:authored-uncertainty\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:actor:f-p-author\",\"re_entry\":[],\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"],\"subject\":\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa