sion:\\n\\n- governs more than one build tenant under this project\\n- chooses a concrete realization that satisfies one or more requirements declared under `specification/requirements/` and that requirement applies across tenants\\n- introduces a structural or interface choice that tenant-local realizations must comply with\\n- supersedes a prior cross-tenant decision\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/templates/build_tenants/common/design/adrs/README_TEMPLATE.md#Common%20Tenant%20ADRs%2FWhen%20to%20write%20a%20cross-tenant%20ADR\",\"start_line\":9},{\"end_line\":14,\"path\":\"standards/templates/build_tenants/variant/design/adrs/README_TEMPLATE.md\",\"quote\":\"Write an ADR here when the decision:\\n\\n- governs only this build tenant (the path segment(s) under `build_tenants/` that identify this tenant, e.g., `<family>/<variant>` or a single-label tenant path)\\n- chooses a concrete realization that satisfies one or more requirements declared under `specification/requirements/`\\n- introduces a structural or interface choice future maintainers will need to know about\\n- supersedes a prior tenant-local decision\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/templates/build_tenants/variant/design/adrs/README_TEMPLATE.md#Tenant%20ADRs%2FWhen%20to%20write%20a%20tenant-local%20ADR\",\"start_line\":9}],\"statement\":\"Both parallel ADR trigger lists lack explicit and/or combination; SPEC_METHOD sections 4 and 10 are also outside the supplied source.\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:context:source-first-proposal","family":"residuals","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:record:dea8a440f5060a0cad866c52a5a5d1b3","key":1985,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:0657852b6fd1fa48457c3f7d:act